es</span></button><button class="conversation">Study group<span>4 new messages</span></button></aside><section class="chat"><h2>Dr. Sarah Johnson</h2><div class="bubble">Hello Alex, your assignment feedback is ready.</div><div class="bubble out">Thank you. I will review it today.</div><div class="composer"><input placeholder="Type a message"/><button>Send</button></div></section></div></main></section></div>{{> theme_custom_lms/partials/global_mini_footer }}
